    "If SleepHoldService is not installed, you may need to disable Mac's automatic sleep feature for these triggers to work effectively.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果未安装 SleepHoldService，你可能需要手动关闭 Mac 的自动睡眠功能，才能让这些触发器有效工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you have Bark installed on your phone, connect to Bark here. For more information, please visit [https://bark.day.app/](https://bark.day.app/).": {
