    "Sentry is running outside of the App Sandbox in a local debug build. Permissions, file access, and release behavior may differ from the signed app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentry 当前在本地调试构建中以 App Sandbox 外运行。权限、文件访问和发布版本行为可能与已签名应用不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sentry will not prevent your Mac from being stolen or damaged, but it can help you locate your Mac or identify the troublemaker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哨兵不能阻止你的 Mac 被偷窃或者损坏，但能一定程度减少这些事情发生的可能性，并帮助你确认是谁闯了祸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
